        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Note that Attr.isConnected is always false]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44349</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44349"/>
        <updated>2026-06-04T01:24:22.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161273586?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #42933.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3860235982" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42933" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/42933/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42933">#42933</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">isConnected</code> always returns <code class="notranslate">false</code> on an {{domxref("Attr")}} node, even when the attribute's <code class="notranslate">ownerElement</code> is connected to the document. This trips people up, so this adds a note explaining why.</p>
<p dir="auto">As <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/caugner/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/caugner">@caugner</a> noted on the issue, this is consistent across Chrome, Firefox, and Safari, and is out of scope for BCD — the spec defines <code class="notranslate">isConnected</code> for all nodes, and since an attribute node has no parent, it has no root that is a document, so it is never "connected".</p>
<p dir="auto">I confirmed the behavior in Chrome:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="const el = document.createElement(&quot;div&quot;);
el.setAttribute(&quot;data-x&quot;, &quot;1&quot;);
const attr = el.getAttributeNode(&quot;data-x&quot;);
document.body.appendChild(el);

el.isConnected;                 // true
attr.ownerElement.isConnected;  // true
attr.isConnected;               // false
attr.parentNode;                // null
attr.getRootNode() === attr;    // true (its root is itself, not the document)"><pre class="notranslate"><span class="pl-k">const</span> <span class="pl-s1">el</span> <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-smi">document</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">createElement</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s">"div"</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
<span class="pl-s1">el</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">setAttribute</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s">"data-x"</span><span class="pl-kos">,</span> <span class="pl-s">"1"</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
<span class="pl-k">const</span> <span class="pl-s1">attr</span> <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-s1">el</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">getAttributeNode</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s">"data-x"</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
<span class="pl-smi">document</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-c1">body</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">appendChild</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s1">el</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>

<span class="pl-s1">el</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-c1">isConnected</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>                 <span class="pl-c">// true</span>
<span class="pl-s1">attr</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-c1">ownerElement</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-c1">isConnected</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>  <span class="pl-c">// true</span>
<span class="pl-s1">attr</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-c1">isConnected</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>               <span class="pl-c">// false</span>
<span class="pl-s1">attr</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-c1">parentNode</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>                <span class="pl-c">// null</span>
<span class="pl-s1">attr</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">getRootNode</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span> <span class="pl-c1">===</span> <span class="pl-s1">attr</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>    <span class="pl-c">// true (its root is itself, not the document)</span></pre></div>]]></content>
